  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "34",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "34",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The New Stone Tablets",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses, \"Chisel out two stone tablets like the first ones, and I will write on them the words that were on the first tablets, which you broke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be ready in the morning, and then come up on Mount Sinai. Present yourself to me there on top of the mountain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No one is to come with you or be seen anywhere on the mountain; not even the flocks and herds may graze in front of the mountain.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses chiseled out two stone tablets like the first ones and went up Mount Sinai early in the morning, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had commanded him; and he carried the two stone tablets in his hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came down in the cloud and stood there with him and proclaimed his name, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he passed in front of Moses, proclaiming, \"The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the compassionate and gracious God, slow to anger, abounding in love and faithfulness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maintaining love to thousands, and forgiving wickedness, rebellion and sin. Yet he does not leave the guilty unpunished; he punishes the children and their children for the sin of the parents to the third and fourth generation.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses bowed to the ground at once and worshiped.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Lord,\" he said, \"if I have found favor in your eyes, then let the Lord go with us. Although this is a stiff-necked people, forgive our wickedness and our sin, and take us as your inheritance.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said: \"I am making a covenant with you. Before all your people I will do wonders never before done in any nation in all the world. The people you live among will see how awesome is the work that I, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", will do for you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obey what I command you today. I will drive out before you the Amorites, Canaanites, Hittites, Perizzites, Hivites and Jebusites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be careful not to make a treaty with those who live in the land where you are going, or they will be a snare among you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Break down their altars, smash their sacred stones and cut down their Asherah poles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not worship any other god, for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", whose name is Jealous, is a jealous God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Be careful not to make a treaty with those who live in the land; for when they prostitute themselves to their gods and sacrifice to them, they will invite you and you will eat their sacrifices.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when you choose some of their daughters as wives for your sons and those daughters prostitute themselves to their gods, they will lead your sons to do the same.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Do not make any idols.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Celebrate the Festival of Unleavened Bread. For seven days eat bread made without yeast, as I commanded you. Do this at the appointed time in the month of Aviv, for in that month you came out of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The first offspring of every womb belongs to me, including all the firstborn males of your livestock, whether from herd or flock.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Redeem the firstborn donkey with a lamb, but if you do not redeem it, break its neck. Redeem all your firstborn sons.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "EXO 34:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"No one is to appear before me empty-handed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Six days you shall labor, but on the seventh day you shall rest; even during the plowing season and harvest you must rest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Celebrate the Festival of Weeks with the firstfruits of the wheat harvest, and the Festival of Ingathering at the turn of the year.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Three times a year all your men are to appear before the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.34.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.34.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
